 one change in a commit of ours: the lazy drafter is used only where a cut can stop it early; `--parallel`'s and `--spec-eval`'s drafts keep one pass. The drafts and the answers are the same with it on and off. We dropped the docs line that quoted another quant format's speeds.\n\nReleased in **v1.1.41**: https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/releases/tag/v1.1.41","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/issues/comments/6518650633/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]